# The image needs three things from this directory: artifacts/, deploy.sh and
# docker-entrypoint.sh. Everything else here is either a source the image never compiles or a
# dependency tree it never reads — and node_modules alone is a few thousand files that would be
# uploaded to the builder on every build for nothing.
#
# The Solidity sources stay out too. The bytecode in artifacts/ was produced once by the pinned
# solc in foundry.toml; shipping the sources beside it would only invite somebody to compile them
# again with whatever compiler happened to be around, and get a different contract.
node_modules
lib
out
cache
broadcast
src
test
script
foundry.toml
package.json
package-lock.json
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
